# Rose Pine — Ghostty 1.0+ built-in. Theme name is case-sensitive
# (verify with `ghostty +list-themes | grep -i rose`). Three Rose Pine
# variants ship (`Rose Pine`, `Rose Pine Moon`, `Rose Pine Dawn`) —
# Main and Moon are wired in this repo; Dawn is deferred.
# Active when ~/.config/ghostty/theme.ghostty → this file (theme-set rose-pine).
theme = Rose Pine
